%% Figure 3.1 - Architecture of Traditional Industrial Monitoring Systems (Existing System)
flowchart TD
    MTR["Industrial Rotating Asset\n(Motor / Gearbox)"] -->|Manual Schedule| TECH["Maintenance Technician\n(Handheld Stethoscope / Pyrometer)"]
